# [BUG-002] Verify item details link accuracy on catalog page

* **Bug ID:** `BUG-002'
* **Title:** Verify item details link accuracy on catalog page
* **Severity:** High
* **Priority:** High
* **Status:** Open
* **Reporter:** Raisibe Maruma
* **Related Test Case ID:** `C65` (Verify item details link accuracy on catalog page)

---

## 💻 Environment

* **Application URL:** `https://www.saucedemo.com/`
* **Browser:** Google Chrome (Latest Version)
* **Operating System:** macOS / Windows
* **User Persona:** `standard_user`


## 📋 Preconditions

1. User is successfully logged in as `standard_user`.

---
### 🐾 Steps to Reproduce
1. Go to [Sauce Demo](https://www.saucedemo.com/).
2. Log in using `standard_user` and `secret_sauce`.
3. Locate **"Sauce Labs Fleece Jacket"** (or specify affected item) on the inventory catalog page.
4. Click on the product name title or item image.
5. Observe the URL parameter (`/inventory-item.html?id=...`) and the rendered item details on the loaded page.

---

### 🎯 Expected Result
The user should be redirected to `inventory-item.html?id=5` displaying the correct title (**"Sauce Labs Fleece Jacket"**), matching description, image, and price ($49.99).

---

### ❌ Actual Result
The link redirects to an mismatched item page (e.g., `inventory-item.html?id=0` - **"Sauce Labs Bike Light"**), displaying incorrect item details and pricing.

---

### ⚠️ Severity & Priority
* **Severity:** Major (Functional discrepancy affecting core navigation and shopping experience)
* **Priority:** High
